[HEADER]
id: wounded_wake
title: In The Wounded Wake
ascii_art: ../art/depths_wake_anim.txt

[CONTENT]
Dark water blooms with ink and sparks from shattered lantern glass.
The beast recoils, but it is still hunting.

[OPTIONS]
dive_shrine | Follow the ink-trail to a stone shrine -> ./shrine.level
strike_heart | Dive now and strike the heart-sack -> ../endings/hunter_glory.level

[DIRECTIVES]
input_mode: choice
ascii_art_mode: animated

[OPTION_CONDITIONS]
option=strike_heart requires_flag=kraken_wounded
